.Dd August 1, 2026
.Dt INTEGRIS-RELEASE-DIGEST 1
.Os
.Sh NAME
.Nm integris-release-digest
.Nd write Integris engineering input-digest manifest
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl root Ar dir
.Op Fl out Ar path
.Sh DESCRIPTION
.Nm
writes an engineering input-digest manifest for the Integris repository.
The manifest records SHA-256 digests of selected source and assurance inputs,
module inventory information, platform, Go version, and residual gaps.
.Pp
The output is an engineering artifact.
It is not release acceptance, certification evidence, or a substitute for the
dual-builder reproducible-release process described in
.Pa docs/release-policy.md
and
.Pa docs/supply-chain.md .
.Ss Options
.Bl -tag -width "-out path"
.It Fl root Ar dir
Repository root (default:
.Pa . ) .
.It Fl out Ar path
Output JSON path.
Default:
.Pa evidence/releases/EVD-RELEASE-001-engineering-manifest.json .
.El
.Sh FILES
.Bl -tag -width "evidence/releases/EVD-RELEASE-001-engineering-manifest.json" -compact
.It Pa go.mod , go.sum , Makefile , README.md , ROADMAP.md
Hashed when present.
.It Pa assurance/requirements.json , assurance/evidence.json
Hashed assurance inputs.
.It Pa evidence/releases/EVD-RELEASE-001-engineering-manifest.json
Default output path.
.El
.Sh EXIT STATUS
.Bl -tag -width Ds -compact
.It 0
Manifest written successfully.
.It 1
Failure reading inputs, invoking host tools, or writing output.
.El
.Sh EXAMPLES
.Bd -literal -offset indent
integris-release-digest -root .
make release-digest
.Ed
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Xr integris-assure 1 ,
.Xr integris-evidence 1 ,
.Xr integris 7
.Pp
.Pa docs/release-policy.md ,
.Pa docs/supply-chain.md
.Sh HISTORY
Added to support engineering digests during M1 without implying release gates
have passed.
.Sh AUTHORS
.An Integris contributors
.Sh CAVEATS
Do not present the engineering manifest as a signed release attestation.
